# slug: ch53-fixups
# source: chapters/ch53.tex:222
# label: alg:ch53-fixups
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch53.tex:225
# caption: Read fixed-size assembly once while retaining symbolic fixups.

REQUIRE parsed statements whose instruction sizes do not depend on symbol values
ENSURE section bytes, definitions, and unresolved field relationships
FORALL statements in source order DO
  IF the statement defines a label THEN
    bind its stable symbol identifier to current section and offset
  END IF
  IF the statement emits an instruction or data field THEN
    append known bytes and reserve the exact size of each unresolved field
    record field offset, symbol identifier, addend, and relocation kind
  ELSE
    apply the directive to section or symbol state
  END IF
END FOR
diagnose unresolved private names and conflicting definitions
serialize bytes, symbols, and translated relocation references

